            "review_title": "Review at Mom since 1995",
            "review_text": "Jacob B\n1 contribution\n0\nWholesome traditional food with friendly locals ... Very authentic\nMar 2018 • Friends\nI was lucky to find this spot by accident while exploring Da Nang. By far the best deal I came across while in this part of Vietnam the food was so fast and absolutely delicious. My favourite was the hibiscus tea . A lot of friendly young people here contributing to the fun of this young establishment\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 2, 2019",
