            "review_title": "Review at Mom since 1995",
            "review_text": "ph_nh2016\n184 contributions\n1\nBinh Dinh \"hoi\" cake\nAug 2018 • Family\nBinh Dinh's desserts are not typical of Danang, but if you are in Danang or travelling here, let's try. \nSpace is the right thing 1995. from curtains to cupboards, floors, etc., but it's a bit hot. This shop is open all day, so the best time is to go to the morning for cool\nAbout the quality of the cake: For the individual, the sauce is slightly dark. If you eat a bit thick, then taste it, it's great\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 18, 2018",
